{"id":"3130f90b274154ec","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation.md","title":"Theorem — 足够多点的箭头分离形式","display":"Theorem — 足够多点的箭头分离形式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation","aliases":["14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation"],"display":"Theorem — 足够多点的箭头分离形式","depends_on":["[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","[[14-df-topos-point]]","[[14-df-enough-points]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 足够多点的箭头分离形式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cced0e71a2282b9\" href=\"?note=3cced0e71a2282b9\" title=\"14-df-topos-point\">14-df-topos-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a60f42d4d762a6d\" href=\"?note=4a60f42d4d762a6d\" title=\"14-df-enough-points\">14-df-enough-points</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 Grothendieck 拓扑斯；点与足够多点见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cced0e71a2282b9\" href=\"?note=3cced0e71a2282b9\" title=\"14-df-topos-point\">14-df-topos-point</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4a60f42d4d762a6d\" href=\"?note=4a60f42d4d762a6d\" title=\"14-df-enough-points\">14-df-enough-points</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasEnoughPoints}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl(u\\ne v\\Rightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsPoint}(p,\\mathcal E)\\land p^*u\\ne p^*v)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HasEnoughPoints}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl(u\\ne v\\Rightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsPoint}(p,\\mathcal E)\\land p^*u\\ne p^*v)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.11 p.521。联合保守⇒联合忠实：若点像都相等，等化子 e 在每个点下成同构，故 e 同构。联合忠实⇒联合保守：若全部点把 f 送成双射，则用忠实性先得 f 单射；f 的像子对象在所有点下满，用分类子箭头与真值比较得该像为全对象，故 f 又满射，拓扑斯中单且满为同构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topos-point","status":"resolved","id":"3cced0e71a2282b9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topos-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-enough-points","status":"resolved","id":"4a60f42d4d762a6d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-enough-points]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topos-point","status":"resolved","id":"3cced0e71a2282b9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 Grothendieck 拓扑斯；点与足够多点见 [[14-df-topos-point]]、[[14-df-enough-points]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-enough-points","status":"resolved","id":"4a60f42d4d762a6d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 Grothendieck 拓扑斯；点与足够多点见 [[14-df-topos-point]]、[[14-df-enough-points]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasEnoughPoints}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl(u\\ne v\\Rightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsPoint}(p,\\mathcal E)\\land p^*u\\ne p^*v)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1281,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation|Theorem — 足够多点的箭头分离形式]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"exc